<name><surname>Inaba</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Sugiura</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Iwata</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Mori</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanaka</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Immunomodulation by Maharishi Amrit Kalash 4 in mice</article-title><source>J Appl Nutr</source><year>1996</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>10</fpage><lpage>21</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sharma</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Dwivedi</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Satter</surname><given-names>BC</given-names></name><name><surname>Gudehithlu</surname><given-names>KP</given-names></name><name><surname>Abou-Issa</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Malarkey</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antineoplastic properties of Maharishi-4 against DMBA-induced mammary tumors in rats</article-title><source>Pharmacol Biochem Behav</source><year>1990</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>767</fpage><lpage>773</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2140606</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0091-3057(90)90356-M</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sharma</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Dwivedi</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Satter</surname><given-names>BC</given-names></name><name><surname>Abou-Issa</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antineoplastic properties of Maharishi Amrit Kalash, an Ayurvedic food supplement, against 7,12-dimethylbenz(a)anthracene-induced mammary tumors in rats</article-title><source>Journal of Research and Education